41
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:51,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the site of the second exam,
the 44th Training Field...</font>

42
00:01:52,170 --> 00:01:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also known as... the Forest of Death.</font>

43
00:01:57,470 --> 00:01:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forest of... Death?</font>

44
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

45
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that supposed to be... a rock?</font>

46
00:02:13,110 --> 00:02:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, on top of the grass?</font>

47
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:44,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Konohamaru!
What is it that you want?!</font>

48
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:47,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what I expect from the man I respect!</font>

49
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:49,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good job on figuring it out!</font>

50
00:03:00,150 --> 00:03:02,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Too much gunpowder used!</font>

51
00:03:07,660 --> 00:03:09,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With an adult sexiness!</font>

52
00:03:09,370 --> 00:03:12,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Moegi of the senior class
at Kunoichi preschool!</font>

53
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love factoring!
Udon!</font>

54
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:19,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most brilliant Ninja in the village!
Konohamaru!</font>

55
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three of us together are
the Konohamaru Gang!</font>

56
00:03:22,890 --> 00:03:23,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we are!</font>

57
00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on you guys?</font>

58
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, I'm about to take the
second exam for the Chunin Exam.</font>

59
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no time to be playing
around with you guys!</font>

60
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:39,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We didn't come to play around!</font>

61
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!
We came here for an interview!</font>

62
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

63
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Interview?</font>

64
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:50,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, we were put in charge to write
the feature article for the "Chunin Exam,"</font>

65
00:03:50,660 --> 00:03:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the academy's class newspaper.</font>

66
00:03:55,130 --> 00:03:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's why we came to
interview you, leader...</font>

67
00:03:58,590 --> 00:04:00,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please cooperate with us.</font>

68
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:02,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please.</font>

69
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

70
00:04:06,260 --> 00:04:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, over there!</font>

71
00:04:07,350 --> 00:04:08,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?!</font>

72
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:15,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru here is asking about
an interview for the class newspaper...</font>

73
00:04:15,690 --> 00:04:21,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I forgot that Lord Hokage was
mentioning something like that.</font>

74
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey...</font>

75
00:04:23,860 --> 00:04:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, take a 10-minute break
starting now!</font>

76
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For those who will be interviewed,
resign yourselves and be courteous.</font>

77
00:04:32,370 --> 00:04:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey... What's this all about?</font>

78
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big brother Naruto!
I'm depending on you.</font>

79
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

80
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case, I'll just show you
how attractive I am!</font>

81
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:49,220
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Must Watch!</font>

82
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:49,220
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Report before Entering the Forest of Death!</font>

83
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:49,220
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">It's The Leaf's School Newspaper!</font>

84
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B"><font color="#b97c32">Chapter of 








Character Introduction</font></font></b></font>

85
00:04:57,360 --> 00:05:00,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please introduce yourself.</font>

86
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

87
00:05:04,030 --> 00:05:06,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

88
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja from Village Hidden
in the Leaves!</font>

89
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:11,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My hobby is to play pranks,
and I love ramen noodles,</font>

90
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:13,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've just become a Genin but...</font>

91
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My dream is big, to become a Hokage!</font>

92
00:05:17,330 --> 00:05:20,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'm going to surpass all
the Hokage from the past,</font>

93
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:24,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and make everybody in the town
acknowledge my existence.</font>

94
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:30,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been called a failure and such,</font>

95
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:33,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I graduated splendidly and,</font>

96
00:05:33,180 --> 00:05:36,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as a member of Group Seven
led by Kakashi-sensei,</font>

97
00:05:36,230 --> 00:05:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am dealing with
difficult missions every day!</font>

98
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Distance from the target?</font>

99
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">5 meters.</font>

100
00:05:43,990 --> 00:05:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm ready anytime.</font>

101
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In Group Seven, there is also
Sasuke and Sakura.</font>

102
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since I'm really the only one that shows
great success,</font>

103
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you don't worry about the other two.</font>

104
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got you!</font>

105
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say such things.
Introduce them properly!</font>

106
00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is the target correct?</font>

107
00:05:59,790 --> 00:06:01,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know, I know.</font>

108
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:03,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The target confirmed.</font>

109
00:06:05,170 --> 00:06:08,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example, this guy's name is
Uchiha Sasuke</font>

110
00:06:08,180 --> 00:06:09,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he's a pretentious guy.</font>

111
00:06:09,890 --> 00:06:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that he's one of the last
remaining of the famous Uchiha clan,</font>

112
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he really is a pitiful guy, like this...</font>

113
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, this was when I transform but...</font>

114
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:31,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as long as you understand the greatness
of my Ninja skills that's all that matters.</font>

115
00:06:33,530 --> 00:06:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, and this is Haruno Sakura
who is in love with me.</font>

116
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:41,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know, the more she denies it,
the more I'm convinced it's true.</font>

117
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She hardly tells me how
she really feels about me but,</font>

118
00:06:43,250 --> 00:06:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">her shyness makes her even cuter!</font>

119
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that true?</font>

120
00:06:49,550 --> 00:06:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It really is true, true.</font>

121
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:56,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's in love with Naruto?!
Shannaro!</font>

122
00:06:57,730 --> 00:06:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a lie after all!</font>

123
00:07:01,690 --> 00:07:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

124
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:07,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, putting that aside,
three of us formed a team</font>

125
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and got through a bunch
of dangerous missions together.</font>

126
00:07:15,370 --> 00:07:16,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you...
What?</font>

127
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:19,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Missus!</font>

128
00:07:19,330 --> 00:07:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've gotten rid of all the weeds!</font>

129
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:24,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?
What's wrong?</font>

130
00:07:24,590 --> 00:07:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those... those aren't weeds...</font>

131
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

132
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are herbs I grew in my garden!</font>

133
00:07:34,470 --> 00:07:36,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch, ouch, ouch!</font>

134
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:45,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody! Help...!</font>

135
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

136
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:51,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Free Fall!</font>

137
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot.</font>

138
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trap Field Do Not Enter
Don't go over there!</font>

139
00:08:01,330 --> 00:08:03,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!
Please stop!</font>

140
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:07,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That fool...</font>

141
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:11,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Geez... All because he
stubbornly chose that big dog.</font>

142
00:08:11,970 --> 00:08:14,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a dangerous mission?</font>

143
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It only looks like you're being clumsy, Naruto.</font>

144
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

145
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, there were times like that too.</font>

146
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it over.</font>

147
00:08:32,610 --> 00:08:33,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

148
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:40,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, this was when I defeated
the Old Man Hokage.</font>

149
00:08:43,620 --> 00:08:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't going to make a good article.</font>

150
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine, then you show me how to do it.</font>

151
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:52,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine! My name is Konohamaru...</font>

152
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:55,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The grandson of the
town's chief Hokage.</font>

153
00:08:55,590 --> 00:08:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandfather is the most important figure
in the Leaf Village</font>

154
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and is the third Hokage.</font>

155
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who succeed the Hokage name
is the top Ninja of the village.</font>

156
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially the 4th Hokage is a great hero
who protected the village</font>

157
00:09:13,900 --> 00:09:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the demon fox!</font>

158
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, hey wait!</font>

159
00:09:18,410 --> 00:09:21,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're only talking about other people!</font>

160
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just about to start on myself!</font>

161
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:29,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, Bro, you talk too much
about yourself!</font>

162
00:09:29,290 --> 00:09:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, I am the star of the article,
other people don't matter!</font>

163
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right, Naruto...</font>

164
00:09:36,930 --> 00:09:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, you're going to forget
about me</font>

165
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:40,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you graduate from the academy.</font>

166
00:09:41,430 --> 00:09:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you can introduce me for a bit...</font>

167
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:47,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yes, yes...</font>

168
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:51,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is the first person in the town
who acknowledged me, Iruka-sensei...</font>

169
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a really nice person,</font>

170
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:57,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he always treats me to
ramen noodles at Ichiraku.</font>

171
00:09:57,820 --> 00:10:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I just a nice person because
I treat you to ramen noodles?</font>

172
00:10:00,830 --> 00:10:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no... well... that's...</font>

173
00:10:03,290 --> 00:10:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't laugh it off!</font>

174
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:08,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big brother, next up,
I'm depending on you!</font>

175
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:10,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, you're right!</font>

176
00:10:11,090 --> 00:10:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, I guess I could talk
about Sasuke's stories of failures...</font>

177
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:19,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've already heard that one.
Get more serious!</font>

178
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:20,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto...!</font>

179
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet he's just making up
stuff as he pleases...</font>

180
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!</font>

181
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who cares...</font>

182
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:33,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B"><font color="#7981df">Chapter of Ninja Art</font></font></b></font>

183
00:10:35,530 --> 00:10:37,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, now we'll have Haruno Sakura,</font>

184
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who is my senior as a Kunoichi,
teach us about Ninja Art.</font>

185
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, I am the beautiful Kunoichi,
Haruno Sakura.</font>

186
00:10:46,330 --> 00:10:47,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beautiful?</font>

187
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, you have any complaints?</font>

188
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no...</font>

189
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

190
00:10:52,710 --> 00:10:55,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well first, Naruto's Ninjutsu...</font>

191
00:10:57,130 --> 00:10:58,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sexy Jutsu,</font>

192
00:11:02,850 --> 00:11:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

193
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:06,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu.</font>

194
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

195
00:11:12,150 --> 00:11:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">- Transform!
- Transform!</font>

196
00:11:13,150 --> 00:11:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">- Transform!
- Transform!</font>

197
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Harem Jutsu...</font>

198
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:30,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I call it, "Harem Jutsu"!</font>

199
00:11:30,250 --> 00:11:31,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And something like this.</font>

200
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

201
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:36,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's his fault that he's late!</font>

202
00:11:45,970 --> 00:11:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dropping the blackboard eraser...</font>

203
00:11:48,850 --> 00:11:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next is the number one rookie, Sasuke,</font>

204
00:11:51,230 --> 00:11:53,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who graduated as
the top student at the academy.</font>

205
00:12:22,050 --> 00:12:24,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't get me by attacking
straight on.</font>

206
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:30,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most popular one in class, he can
also fight Kakashi-sensei as an equal.</font>

207
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:32,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is awesome!</font>

208
00:12:42,990 --> 00:12:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your Sasuke introduction
is taking too long.</font>

209
00:12:45,950 --> 00:12:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you're so noisy.</font>

210
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay quiet.</font>

211
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:50,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Horse!</font>

212
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:51,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tiger!</font>

213
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

214
00:12:55,370 --> 00:12:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

215
00:12:56,630 --> 00:12:58,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not a Jutsu Genin can use...</font>

216
00:12:59,130 --> 00:13:01,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He couldn't have enough Chakra!</font>

217
00:13:15,230 --> 00:13:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Wind Shuriken
Windmill of Shadows.</font>

218
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:23,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shuriken won't work on me.</font>

219
00:13:31,490 --> 00:13:33,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it.</font>

220
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C-Could that be...?</font>

221
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

222
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that, the Sharingan...?</font>

223
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:49,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this is the same Kekkei Genkai
as Kakashi-sensei's...</font>

224
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:52,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he can read Bushy-Brow's Jutsu!</font>

225
00:13:53,310 --> 00:13:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu or Ninjutsu...
it's some kind of magic either way.</font>

226
00:13:58,350 --> 00:13:59,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll reveal that!</font>

227
00:14:11,660 --> 00:14:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although you have seen Sasuke
using powerful Jutsu like</font>

228
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Fire Ball Jutsu,
Demon Wind Shuriken,</font>

229
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Windmill Shadow, and Sharingan,</font>

230
00:14:22,670 --> 00:14:24,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the greatest of all is...</font>

231
00:14:32,050 --> 00:14:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the sharp look of his eyes!</font>

232
00:14:34,390 --> 00:14:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Any girl who has been stared
at with those eyes,</font>

233
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:39,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will fall in love with him!</font>

234
00:14:39,810 --> 00:14:43,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!
Look this way!</font>

235
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... annoying.</font>

236
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:52,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that cold behavior is also
another attractive quality of Sasuke...</font>

237
00:14:55,790 --> 00:15:00,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next is our teacher,
Kakashi Hatake Sensei,</font>

238
00:15:00,750 --> 00:15:03,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">also known as
the Copy Ninja Kakashi.</font>

239
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He uses the Sharingan in his eye
to assess the enemy's technique</font>

240
00:15:07,210 --> 00:15:09,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and copy over
a thousand Jutsu techniques.</font>

241
00:15:18,310 --> 00:15:22,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he's always late to meet people,
and whenever he has any time</font>

242
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he always reads this questionable book
called Make-Out Paradise,</font>

243
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:27,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he always looks like he
doesn't really care about things...</font>

244
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:29,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Village Secret Finger Jutsu:</font>

245
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:35,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Thousand Years of Death!</font>

246
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:43,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the biggest mystery of all
is his face hidden under that mask!</font>

247
00:15:43,670 --> 00:15:45,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what he really looks like...</font>

248
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art, Summoning,
Earth Style: Fanged Pursuit Jutsu!</font>

249
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can't use your eyes or ears,
simply use your nose.</font>

250
00:16:18,330 --> 00:16:21,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what happens when
you're closing your eyes in the midst of fog.</font>

251
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Summoning Jutsu
specialized for pursuit.</font>

252
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:31,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of all that, why does he
have the Sharingan in his left eye</font>

253
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:33,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that is only passed on in the Uchiha clan?</font>

254
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:36,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One mystery after another when
it comes to this person,</font>

255
00:16:36,890 --> 00:16:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so many things that I don't understand...</font>

256
00:16:38,470 --> 00:16:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should ask him next time
I have the chance.</font>

257
00:16:45,770 --> 00:16:46,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lightning Blade!</font>

258
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

259
00:16:49,190 --> 00:16:52,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His hand is...
visibly overflowing with Chakra!</font>

260
00:16:55,530 --> 00:16:57,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are too dangerous.</font>

261
00:17:00,830 --> 00:17:02,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Prison Jutsu.</font>

262
00:17:02,830 --> 00:17:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

263
00:17:06,670 --> 00:17:07,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Secret Jutsu.</font>

264
00:17:17,090 --> 00:17:18,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crystal Ice Mirrors!</font>

265
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:22,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next up are the Ninjutsu of
the other Ninja besides us.</font>

266
00:17:22,850 --> 00:17:27,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's such a diverse collection of
Ninjutsu that I have no time to explain all...</font>

267
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:35,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B"><font color="#7981df">Chapter of Rivals</font></font></b></font>

268
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:38,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, Sasuke,
whom I feel is like my future self,</font>

269
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">take care of the next part.</font>

270
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure. After all, I have to be the one
to do something about it.</font>

271
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew that from the beginning.</font>

272
00:17:51,630 --> 00:17:54,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't try so hard to look cool.</font>

273
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:55,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, the snob.</font>

274
00:17:56,550 --> 00:17:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't interfere.</font>

275
00:17:58,430 --> 00:18:00,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay out of it, loser.</font>

276
00:18:00,430 --> 00:18:01,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Annoying.</font>

277
00:18:01,890 --> 00:18:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

278
00:18:03,100 --> 00:18:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hate the fact that only you stand out.</font>

279
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody strong around you
shows any interest in you.</font>

280
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

281
00:18:15,490 --> 00:18:16,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just watch this.</font>

282
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

283
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You there...
What's your name?</font>

284
00:18:22,490 --> 00:18:27,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Gaara of the desert.
I have an interest in you as well...</font>

285
00:18:28,330 --> 00:18:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's your name?</font>

286
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

287
00:18:32,290 --> 00:18:35,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you there.
Identify yourself.</font>

288
00:18:37,470 --> 00:18:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dang it!
Again? It's always about Sasuke!</font>

289
00:18:41,050 --> 00:18:44,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When asking someone his name,
give your own name first.</font>

290
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:48,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, with the unpleasant look.</font>

291
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:49,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute!</font>

292
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:58,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you fight with me here now?</font>

293
00:18:58,570 --> 00:19:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I AM going to take out the Bushy-Brow!</font>

294
00:19:01,910 --> 00:19:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one I want to fight isn't you...
